- Parents: positive finite autonomous one-time construction and finite energy
  supply; all supplied-model and spectral/preparation hypotheses remain.
- New steps: whole-space Julia small-gate bound, direct interaction-picture
  lift, squared-sine clock variance, joint interval comparison, correlated
  battery hybrid and exact original-mark bin comparison.
- Bound: unconditioned tester distance at the last counted observation,
